    "body": "If/when HTML modules ever happen I think you'll want script modules to be able to define exports, that way the HTML module's exports could (maybe, potentially) be made up of its children script modules' exports.\r\n\r\nHere's an old gist from @domenic that has an idea that includes script elements including a module property: https://gist.github.com/domenic/fd84ee5f4e2dc0278ab1#file-import-module-maybe-js",
