    "body": "Yes, this may play a role in the future with HTML modules, but as modules are specced right now it's not useful, as `<script type=\"module\">` is only for top-level modules, which are at the root of the graph and thus do not export anything.\r\n\r\nClosing, but we might reopen if we end up needing this for HTML modules or similar.",
